Ramify
======

This project includes code ported from IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition, and test data taken
from that same repository.

Origin
------

  Project:   IntelliJ IDEA Community Edition (JetBrains/intellij-community)
  Tag:       idea/241.14494.240 (build IC-241.14494.240, version 2024.1)
  Copyright: JetBrains s.r.o. and contributors. The year of each original file appears in its
             header, at that tag.
  License:   Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0)

The blocks below that state no tag of their own, from "Ported code: src-tauri/src/log/" to
"Ported code: HEAD, staged and local in three panes", and the test data of
src-tauri/src/log/testdata/, were written in phases 1 to 3 by reading the tag idea/232.10072.27
(build IC-232.10072.27, version 2023.2.3), the reference until phase 4 moved it to 2024.1; an
entry there that names another tag was read at that one.
docs/reports/phase-4-reference-change.md compares the two tags for those features. Every later
block names the tag it was read at.

Changes
-------

The files were ported from Java and Kotlin to Rust and TypeScript, and adapted: the graph's
data structure, the interface with the rest of the application and the names are not the
original ones. The behaviour is preserved, and the graph tests compare it with IntelliJ's
outputs. Each file states in its comments the class or method it comes from.

A copy of the license is in LICENSE-APACHE.

